{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"mdeet-2022-biology-07","exam":"MDEET","year":2022,"subject":"biology","number":7,"points":4,"unitId":"trafficking","unitLabel":"세포 내 수송·단백질 처리","topic":"소포","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["trafficking","respiratory","circulation"],"stem":"그림은 단백질 ㉠～㉢의 산소포화도 곡선을 나타낸 것이다. ㉠～㉢은\n각각 미오글로빈, 헤모글로빈, 일산화탄소(CO)-헤모글로빈 중 하나\n이며, CO-헤모글로빈의 CO 포화도는 50%이다.\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n<보 기>\nㄱ. ㉠은 미오글로빈이다.\nㄴ. 산소에 대한 친화도는 ㉢보다 ㉡이 높다.\nㄷ. 헤모글로빈에 대한 친화도는 일산화탄소보다 산소가 높다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t009"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t010"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t011"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]}],"answer":1,"acceptedAnswers":[1],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":439,"height":347,"region":0,"bbox":[81.9,68.503,175.6,138.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2022-biology-07/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":776,"height":195,"region":0,"bbox":[14.3,262.103,310.4,78.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t005","t006","t007","t008"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2022-biology-07/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":4,"sourceRect":[82.9,152.297,417.0,523.342],"width":334.1,"height":371.045,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[81.9,68.503,175.6,138.8],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.3,262.103,310.4,78.0],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"7. 그림은 단백질 ㉠～㉢의 산소포화도 곡선을 나타낸 것이다. ㉠～㉢은","bbox":[5.0,5.0,318.966,12.276],"spans":[{"text":"7.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,10.0,12.276],"origin":[5.0,14.024],"size":11.696,"flags":4,"font":"*ÇÑ¾ç°ß¸íÁ¶"},{"text":" 그림은 단백질 ","bbox":[15.0,5.752,73.257,11.373],"origin":